  ---
  📦 Dependencies

  - CoreML — on-device model inference (Apple framework, no install needed)
  - SwiftUI — declarative UI framework (Apple framework, no install needed)
  - (Optional) AVFoundation — for live video stream detection

  No third-party Swift packages required.

  ---
  ❓ FAQ

  Does this work offline?
  Yes — everything runs on-device via CoreML. No internet connection needed after installation.

  Can I add more defect classes?
  Yes. Retrain YOLOv8 with your classes, re-export with yolo export model=defect_detect.pt format=coreml, and replace
  defect_detect.mlpackage.

  Why are there two model files (.mlmodel and .mlpackage)?
  .mlpackage is the newer, preferred format with faster load times and better hardware utilization. The .mlmodel is a legacy artifact
  kept for reference. The app uses .mlpackage.

  Will it work on the iOS Simulator?
  It builds and runs, but the camera is unavailable. Use a physical device for real detection and accurate performance benchmarks.

